id: snack
name: Snack
kind: gear
tags: food
craftDC: Apprentice
# "You can spend 1 Action to consume this Item."
placeCost: 1
consumed: true
# "Regain 1d10(bT) Life and Ki Points." A roll for each, the way Combat Recovery rolls its
# "regain 1d10(bT) Life and Ki Points": the base Tier of whoever eats it.
healDice: 1d10
healScale: bT
healKi: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Eat it for an Action: regain 1d10(bT) Life Points and 1d10(bT) Ki Points.
text: >
  Snack [Food]: A delicious and satisfying treat to keep you going when your energy is low.
  –Craft DC: Apprentice
  –Effects: You can spend 1 Action to consume this Item and regain 1d10(bT) Life and Ki
  Points. Consuming a Snack will also reduce your Hunger by 1 until the end of the Combat
  Encounter.

---

# Consume: 1 Action, 1d10(bT) Life Points and 1d10(bT) Ki Points - two rolls, neither past its
# maximum - and the Snack is eaten.
#
# [Food]: made with a Cooking Skill Check of the Craft DC, through the Create Maneuver or
# Magic Materialization. Neither is in this system yet; the tag is carried for when they are.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# "Consuming a Snack will also reduce your Hunger by 1 until the end of the Combat Encounter."
# There is no Hunger in this system yet. When it arrives, this is a reduction of 1 per Snack
# eaten, lasting to the end of the Combat Encounter.
